WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:10.760 --> 00:00:12.137
Good morning.

00:00:12.220 --> 00:00:13.471
Yumeko!

00:00:13.555 --> 00:00:15.306
What are you looking at?

00:00:16.099 --> 00:00:17.767
This is...

00:00:18.309 --> 00:00:22.689
She's an indie idol
and a member of the student council too.

00:00:23.440 --> 00:00:26.776
Oh, I didn't know there was someone
like that on the student council.

00:00:27.360 --> 00:00:28.486
Yumemi Yumemite.

00:00:28.903 --> 00:00:31.322
She's a second-year student.
She's in charge of publicity.

00:00:31.406 --> 00:00:33.783
She's gotten three million views
on YourTube,

00:00:34.409 --> 00:00:37.328
and they say she's sure to make it big.

00:00:38.079 --> 00:00:41.249
Sometimes, she does concerts at school,

00:00:41.332 --> 00:00:45.086
but she's so popular, unless you're
in her fan club, you can't get in.

00:00:46.296 --> 00:00:52.802
- You know a lot about her, huh?
- As a classmate, I want to support her,

00:00:52.886 --> 00:00:55.930
- but the club fees are expensive.
- Thanks, everybody!

00:00:56.014 --> 00:01:01.186
If you enjoyed it, click "like" and spread
the word! Share me with your friends!

00:01:03.271 --> 00:01:04.105
Huh?

00:01:04.647 --> 00:01:05.690
What's this?

